{"2965400": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "EQUIRE", "steam_appid": 2965400, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on the challenge of building and managing your dream horse ranch. Ride in competitions to rise through the ranks and become one of the best, or focus on creating the perfect experience for your guests to attract them in masses. Become a renowned breeder who sells horses worldwide, or simply enjoy a cozy life with the horses on the estate you always dreamed of. Whatever you choose, the world is yours!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2965400/extras/abb3041556357a79677e96ab7b6528ec.poster.avif?t=1780565455\" width=620 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2965400/extras/abb3041556357a79677e96ab7b6528ec.webm?t=1780565455\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2965400/extras/abb3041556357a79677e96ab7b6528ec.mp4?t=1780565455\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience horse-riding gameplay that combines realism with fun. If you’re up to the challenge, compete in show-jumping and cross-country events that are easy to learn but hard to master. As you and your horses improve, you can enter more advanced competitions and fight for greater rewards. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2965400/extras/fa40764da22e1c116113bb1ce8f5490e.poster.avif?t=1780565455\" width=620 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2965400/extras/fa40764da22e1c116113bb1ce8f5490e.webm?t=1780565455\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2965400/extras/fa40764da22e1c116113bb1ce8f5490e.mp4?t=1780565455\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >EQUIRE combines large-scale building from a top-down perspective with precise placement of smaller objects in first-person. This gives you all the tools you need to build the horse ranch of your dreams. Whether that means creating a breathtaking resort that guests never want to leave, or a personal equestrian retreat where you can unwind after thrilling competitions or the stress of everyday life. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2965400/extras/3797823d805d898d27870c72e061a19c.poster.avif?t=1780565455\" width=620 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2965400/extras/3797823d805d898d27870c72e061a19c.webm?t=1780565455\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2965400/extras/3797823d805d898d27870c72e061a19c.mp4?t=1780565455\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Owning horses and running a ranch is more than just riding. Breed, train, and trade horses as you plan the financing of your next building project or horse purchase. Open your ranch to visitors and choose activities that match their interests. Hiring the right staff not only affects many aspects of your ranch but also helps remove gameplay that would otherwise feel like a chore. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2965400/extras/9d04f89bb2de9af924f8d1557b6f18ba.poster.avif?t=1780565455\" width=620 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2965400/extras/9d04f89bb2de9af924f8d1557b6f18ba.webm?t=1780565455\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2965400/extras/9d04f89bb2de9af924f8d1557b6f18ba.mp4?t=1780565455\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In EQUIRE, your estate sits within a protected nature reserve threatened by a global oil company seeking to exploit its resources. As you expand your ranch, the money and reputation you earn allow you to reclaim increasingly large areas of the reserve. Explore diverse biomes on horseback, clean up the damage left behind, and rebuild the reserve’s infrastructure.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on the challenge of building and managing your dream horse ranch. Ride in competitions to rise through the ranks and become one of the best, or focus on creating the perfect experience for your guests to attract them in masses. Become a renowned breeder who sells horses worldwide, or simply enjoy a cozy life with the horses on the estate you always dreamed of. Whatever you choose, the world is yours!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2965400/extras/abb3041556357a79677e96ab7b6528ec.poster.avif?t=1780565455\" width=620 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2965400/extras/abb3041556357a79677e96ab7b6528ec.webm?t=1780565455\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2965400/extras/abb3041556357a79677e96ab7b6528ec.mp4?t=1780565455\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience horse-riding gameplay that combines realism with fun. If you’re up to the challenge, compete in show-jumping and cross-country events that are easy to learn but hard to master. As you and your horses improve, you can enter more advanced competitions and fight for greater rewards. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2965400/extras/fa40764da22e1c116113bb1ce8f5490e.poster.avif?t=1780565455\" width=620 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2965400/extras/fa40764da22e1c116113bb1ce8f5490e.webm?t=1780565455\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2965400/extras/fa40764da22e1c116113bb1ce8f5490e.mp4?t=1780565455\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >EQUIRE combines large-scale building from a top-down perspective with precise placement of smaller objects in first-person. This gives you all the tools you need to build the horse ranch of your dreams. Whether that means creating a breathtaking resort that guests never want to leave, or a personal equestrian retreat where you can unwind after thrilling competitions or the stress of everyday life. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2965400/extras/3797823d805d898d27870c72e061a19c.poster.avif?t=1780565455\" width=620 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2965400/extras/3797823d805d898d27870c72e061a19c.webm?t=1780565455\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2965400/extras/3797823d805d898d27870c72e061a19c.mp4?t=1780565455\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Owning horses and running a ranch is more than just riding. Breed, train, and trade horses as you plan the financing of your next building project or horse purchase. Open your ranch to visitors and choose activities that match their interests. Hiring the right staff not only affects many aspects of your ranch but also helps remove gameplay that would otherwise feel like a chore. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2965400/extras/9d04f89bb2de9af924f8d1557b6f18ba.poster.avif?t=1780565455\" width=620 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2965400/extras/9d04f89bb2de9af924f8d1557b6f18ba.webm?t=1780565455\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2965400/extras/9d04f89bb2de9af924f8d1557b6f18ba.mp4?t=1780565455\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In EQUIRE, your estate sits within a protected nature reserve threatened by a global oil company seeking to exploit its resources. As you expand your ranch, the money and reputation you earn allow you to reclaim increasingly large areas of the reserve. Explore diverse biomes on horseback, clean up the damage left behind, and rebuild the reserve’s infrastructure.</p>", "short_description": "Take the reins and ride in this immersive horse-ranch simulation. Build your dream ranch and establish deep bonds with your horses. You are the boss! Manage staff and guests, or focus on challenging competitions. Breed, trade, and raise foals as you shape the future of your ranch.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, German<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2965400/b77fb42d40240f40b98d16bf95492e13a225a860/header.jpg?t=1780565455", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2965400/fe9fa901ac3e1976426bdbad91e6074594a90be6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1780565455", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2965400/fe9fa901ac3e1976426bdbad91e6074594a90be6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1780565455", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> TBD</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["NobleCourt"], "publishers": ["NobleCourt"], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 28, "description": "Full controller support"}, {"id": 60, "description": "Gamepad Recommended"}, {"id": 62, "description": "Family Sharing"}], "genres": [{"id": "4", "description": "Casual"}, {"id": "23", "description": "Indie"}, {"id": "28", "description": "Simulation"}, {"id": "18", "description": "S